{%- comment -%}
  Full-Time Enrolment · How full-time works (Wireframe A · S3)

  Sept 2026: the "2 to 4 courses at a time" model was retired. Every course a
  student selects now opens at the start of the term and they work through them
  in any order across the 12 months. The dark panel carries the dedicated
  counsellor message so the flexibility does not read as being left on your own.

  Copy is hardcoded rather than driven by section settings and blocks. The
  previous version stored its copy in the template JSON, which meant pushing
  this file changed nothing on the live page. Everything below renders from the
  file itself. Edit here, push, done.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="fte-how" aria-labelledby="fte-how-heading-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="fte-how__inner">

    <div class="fte-how__head">
      <p class="fte-how__eyebrow">How full-time works</p>
      <h2 class="fte-how__heading" id="fte-how-heading-{{ section.id }}">Enrol once. Your counsellor takes it from there.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="fte-how__steps" role="list" aria-label="How full-time enrolment works" style="--fte-cols: 5">

      <div class="fte-how__step" role="listitem">
        <div class="fte-how__step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-title">Enrol</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-body">Choose your grade and enrol online, any day of the year.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="fte-how__step" role="listitem">
        <div class="fte-how__step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-title">Complete the enrolment form</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-body">A few minutes, right after checkout.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="fte-how__step" role="listitem">
        <div class="fte-how__step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-title">Your counsellor reaches out</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-body">A guidance counsellor dedicated to full-time students contacts you to book your session.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="fte-how__step" role="listitem">
        <div class="fte-how__step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-title">Your guidance session</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-body">Prerequisites confirmed, transfer credits evaluated, courses selected, pathway plan built.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="fte-how__step" role="listitem">
        <div class="fte-how__step-num" aria-hidden="true">5</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-title">Every course opens</div>
        <div class="fte-how__step-body">All of your courses open in Google Classroom and your 12-month term begins.</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="fte-how__pacing">
      <div class="fte-how__pacing-lead">
        <span class="fte-how__pacing-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="fte-how__pacing-heading">Self-paced does not mean on your own.</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="fte-how__pacing-text">
        <p class="fte-how__pacing-body">Every course opens at the start of your term, so you decide what to start and when. What you do not do is work it out alone. A guidance counsellor is assigned to every full-time student, reaches out after you enrol, and stays with you until you graduate.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.fte-how {
  background: var(--light, #f0f1f5);
  padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 10px) 0;
}

.fte-how__inner {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 32px;
}

.fte-how__head {
  max-width: 920px;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.fte-how__eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #98a0bf;
}

.fte-how__heading {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.45rem);
  text-wrap: balance;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: #24367a;
}

/* Steps */
.fte-how__steps {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--fte-cols, 5), minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 24px 22px;
  padding-top: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.fte-how__steps::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 30px;
  left: 12px;
  right: 12px;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(151, 163, 206, 0) 0%, rgba(151, 163, 206, 0.32) 10%, rgba(151, 163, 206, 0.32) 90%, rgba(151, 163, 206, 0) 100%);
  z-index: 0;
}

.fte-how__step {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
}

.fte-how__step-num {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(36, 54, 122, 0.24);
  background: #ffffff;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #24367a;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(17, 33, 89, 0.15);
}

.fte-how__step-title {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #24367a;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  max-width: 200px;
}

.fte-how__step-body {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #6f789f;
  max-width: 200px;
}

/* Pull-quote panel */
.fte-how__pacing {
  background: var(--color-dark, #1e2460);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 24px 48px;
}

.fte-how__pacing-lead {
  flex: 0 1 340px;
}

.fte-how__pacing-rule {
  display: block;
  width: 40px;
  height: 3px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #F0C417;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.fte-how__pacing-heading {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.4vw, 1.9rem);
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  text-wrap: balance;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.fte-how__pacing-text {
  flex: 1 1 340px;
}

.fte-how__pacing-body {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fte-how__steps {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 26px 20px;
  }
  .fte-how__steps::before {
    display: none;
  }
   .fte-how__step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    column-gap: 14px;
    row-gap: 5px;
    align-items: start;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .fte-how__step-num {
    grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .fte-how__step-title,
  .fte-how__step-body {
    grid-column: 2;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .fte-how__step-title {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .fte-how__inner {
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .fte-how__steps {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FTE How It Works",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "fte-section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FTE How It Works"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
